      "title": "MRK Q3 Earnings & Sales Beat Estimates, '26 EPS View Raised, Stock Up",
      "summary": "Merck (MRK) beat Q3 2026 earnings and revenue estimates with adjusted EPS of $2.49 and revenues of $18.09 billion. Keytruda sales grew 6% to $8.60 billion, while newer products like Winrevair, Welireg, and Enflonsia showed strong momentum. The company raised its 2026 guidance for adjusted EPS to $2.77-$2.82 and sales to $66.8-$67.3 billion. However, established drugs like Januvia/Janumet and Bridion faced headwinds from generic competition.",
